<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Services.</p>
<p>Prices as of November 1, 1996</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were 15 to 25 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was steady to 5.00 lower.  Crude Sunflower Oil was steady to 75 points lower.</p>
